    <!-- Voice command help -->
    <string name="commands_help">After a message is read, say:\n• \"Reply\" – then dictate your answer\n• \"Reply saying I\'m on my way\" – reply in one go\n• \"Repeat\" – hear the message again\n• \"Read more\" – hear a long message in full\n• \"Call back\" – phone the sender (if enabled)\n• \"Ignore\" or stay silent – move on\n• \"Stop\" – stop reading for now\n\nWhen your reply is read back, say \"Send\", \"Change\" or \"Cancel\".</string>

